---
layout: none
permalink: /_redirects
sitemap_exclude: true
---
<%
  # Netlify reads _redirects from the publish directory alongside
  # netlify.toml. One line per article carrying a former_slug — this is
  # what makes a retitle "free" (Spec0024 Part 6): the old Kit URL keeps
  # resolving without a hand-written rule.
  renamed = site.collections.articles.resources.select { |r| r.data.former_slug }
%>
<% renamed.each do |article| %>
/posts/<%= article.data.former_slug %>/* /posts/<%= article.data.slug %>/ 301!
<% end %>
